{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"[{\"title\":\"The Other Side of the Sea\",\"number\":1,\"airDate\":\"2020-12-07\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"As Marley battles the Mid-East Alliance to end a four-year war, a group of Warrior candidates on the front lines compete to be the successor of the Armored Titan.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/267440/episodes/5fc6839cec05e.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"海の向こう側\"},{\"title\":\"Midnight Train\",\"number\":2,\"airDate\":\"2020-12-14\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Though glad the war is over, both the Eldian Warriors and Marley brass realize that neither have a future unless they finish the job of retaking the Founding Titan.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/267440/episodes/5fd48c1c99146.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"闇夜の列車\"},{\"title\":\"The Door of Hope\",\"number\":3,\"airDate\":\"2020-12-21\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Reiner reflects on his past, remembering what pushed him to become a Warrior and keep moving forward when all hope was lost.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/267440/episodes/5fdb890fe48ee.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"希望の扉\"},{\"title\":\"From One Hand to Another\",\"number\":4,\"airDate\":\"2020-12-28\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"A sudden visit from the Tybur family shakes up the Marleyan military. Meanwhile, Falco smuggles letters for a friend and helps two old comrades reunite.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/267440/episodes/5fe329c1c1189.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"手から手へ\"},{\"title\":\"Declaration of War\",\"number\":5,\"airDate\":\"2021-01-11\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"While Willy Tybur reveals the truth in a shocking speech to the world, tensions rise behind the stage as Eren and Reiner meet face to face.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/267440/episodes/600bd185aca14.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"宣戦布告\"},{\"title\":\"The War Hammer Titan\",\"number\":6,\"airDate\":\"2021-01-18\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Eren's rampage is thwarted by the War Hammer Titan whose tenacity leaves him stumped. With Marley's military joining the fight, he'll be hard-pressed to survive on his own.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/267440/episodes/600bd19490975.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"戦鎚[つい]の巨人\"},{\"title\":\"Assault\",\"number\":7,\"airDate\":\"2021-01-25\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"The forces of Paradis begin their assault, but the Warriors stand their ground. As Marley troops close in around them, Eren struggles to break the War Hammer's defenses.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/267440/episodes/60171fd476799.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"強襲\"},{\"title\":\"Assassin`s Bullet\",\"number\":8,\"airDate\":\"2021-02-01\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"With no Titans left to threaten their escape, the Scouts retreat on the airship. Determined to make them pay for trampling on her home, Gabi chases after with gun in hand.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/267440/episodes/600df179ad7f8.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"凶弾\"},{\"title\":\"Brave Volunteers\",\"number\":9,\"airDate\":\"2021-02-08\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"As Paradis deals with the aftermath of the raid on Liberio, Armin looks back in the past to meeting the volunteer soldiers who reshaped their world.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/267440/episodes/6017235a465cd.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"義勇兵\"},{\"title\":\"A Sound Argument\",\"number\":10,\"airDate\":\"2021-02-15\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Two years ago, Paradis welcomed their first visitor who was surprised to see one of their own. Obtaining their help will be critical in a three-part plan to protect Paradis.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/267440/episodes/64089b7646168.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"正論\"},{\"title\":\"Deceiver\",\"number\":11,\"airDate\":\"2021-02-22\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Trapped on the world's most dangerous island, Falco and Gabi will do anything to survive. Elsewhere, the public demands answers when they learn the savior of Paradis has been detained.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/267440/episodes/6032b892c196b.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"偽り者\"},{\"title\":\"Guides\",\"number\":12,\"airDate\":\"2021-03-01\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"While Hange and Pyxis piece together Zeke's true intentions, tension builds outside HQ where Armin and Mikasa plead for permission to speak with Eren.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/267440/episodes/6034bdb996a9f.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"導く者\"},{\"title\":\"Children of the Forest\",\"number\":13,\"airDate\":\"2021-03-08\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Gabi and Falco seek assistance from the captured Marleyan soldiers. Will their faith in their countrymen be rewarded or betrayed?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/267440/episodes/60403c9d7e079.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"森の子ら\"},{\"title\":\"Savagery\",\"number\":14,\"airDate\":\"2021-03-22\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Armin and Mikasa speak with Eren, but are astounded by what he says. In the forest, Levi considers feeding the Beast Titan to someone new, but Zeke has other plans in mind.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/8085636/screencap/604d7f7a1a0f5.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"暴悪\"},{\"title\":\"Sole Salvation\",\"number\":15,\"airDate\":\"2021-03-22\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"A look into Zeke's past shows his struggle to become a Warrior. His plans to end the suffering of all Eldians stems from a chance friendship made in his youth.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/8085637/screencap/6052c20bd7ef0.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"唯一の救い\"},{\"title\":\"Above and Below\",\"number\":16,\"airDate\":\"2021-03-29\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"With the Jaegerists now in charge, Zeke's master plan is revealed. But before it is put in motion, Eren recruits help to flush out any invaders in their midst.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/8085638/screencap/6059c5f6cd8e2.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"天地\"}]","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":3600,"tags":[]}